{"audio": "john-14.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 223867, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1467, "text": "John, Chapter Fourteen."}, {"start_ms": 1467, "end_ms": 6400, "text": "Let not your heart be troubled: ye believe in God, believe also in me."}, {"start_ms": 6400, "end_ms": 11467, "text": "In my Father's house are many mansions: if it were not so, I would have told you."}, {"start_ms": 11467, "end_ms": 13867, "text": "I go to prepare a place for you."}, {"start_ms": 13867, "end_ms": 20933, "text": "And if I go and prepare a place for you, I will come again, and receive you unto myself; that where I am, there ye may be also."}, {"start_ms": 20933, "end_ms": 24267, "text": "And whither I go ye know, and the way ye know."}, {"start_ms": 24267, "end_ms": 30133, "text": "Thomas saith unto him, Lord, we know not whither thou goest; and how can we know the way?"}, {"start_ms": 30133, "end_ms": 37867, "text": "Jesus saith unto him, I am the way, the truth, and the life: no man cometh unto the Father, but by me."}, {"start_ms": 37867, "end_ms": 44533, "text": "If ye had known me, ye should have known my Father also: and from henceforth ye know him, and have seen him."}, {"start_ms": 44533, "end_ms": 49333, "text": "Philip saith unto him, Lord, shew us the Father, and it sufficeth us."}, {"start_ms": 49333, "end_ms": 55467, "text": "Jesus saith unto him, Have I been so long time with you, and yet hast thou not known me, Philip?"}, {"start_ms": 55467, "end_ms": 60667, "text": "he that hath seen me hath seen the Father; and how sayest thou then, Shew us the Father?"}, {"start_ms": 60667, "end_ms": 64933, "text": "Believest thou not that I am in the Father, and the Father in me?"}, {"start_ms": 64933, "end_ms": 71733, "text": "the words that I speak unto you I speak not of myself: but the Father that dwelleth in me, he doeth the works."}, {"start_ms": 71733, "end_ms": 78000, "text": "Believe me that I am in the Father, and the Father in me: or else believe me for the very works' sake."}, {"start_ms": 78000, "end_ms": 88133, "text": "Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that believeth on me, the works that I do shall he do also; and greater works than these shall he do; because I go unto my Father."}, {"start_ms": 88133, "end_ms": 93867, "text": "And whatsoever ye shall ask in my name, that will I do, that the Father may be glorified in the Son."}, {"start_ms": 93867, "end_ms": 97467, "text": "If ye shall ask any thing in my name, I will do it."}, {"start_ms": 97467, "end_ms": 100267, "text": "If ye love me, keep my commandments."}, {"start_ms": 100267, "end_ms": 116133, "text": "And I will pray the Father, and he shall give you another Comforter, that he may abide with you for ever; Even the Spirit of truth; whom the world cannot receive, because it seeth him not, neither knoweth him: but ye know him; for he dwelleth with you, and shall be in you."}, {"start_ms": 116133, "end_ms": 119600, "text": "I will not leave you comfortless: I will come to you."}, {"start_ms": 119600, "end_ms": 126267, "text": "Yet a little while, and the world seeth me no more; but ye see me: because I live, ye shall live also."}, {"start_ms": 126267, "end_ms": 132000, "text": "At that day ye shall know that I am in my Father, and ye in me, and I in you."}, {"start_ms": 132000, "end_ms": 143733, "text": "He that hath my commandments, and keepeth them, he it is that loveth me: and he that loveth me shall be loved of my Father, and I will love him, and will manifest myself to him."}, {"start_ms": 143733, "end_ms": 150800, "text": "Judas saith unto him, not Iscariot, Lord, how is it that thou wilt manifest thyself unto us, and not unto the world?"}, {"start_ms": 150800, "end_ms": 159600, "text": "Jesus answered and said unto him, If a man love me, he will keep my words: and my Father will love him, and we will come unto him, and make our abode with him."}, {"start_ms": 159600, "end_ms": 166400, "text": "He that loveth me not keepeth not my sayings: and the word which ye hear is not mine, but the Father's which sent me."}, {"start_ms": 166400, "end_ms": 170533, "text": "These things have I spoken unto you, being yet present with you."}, {"start_ms": 170533, "end_ms": 181067, "text": "But the Comforter, which is the Holy Ghost, whom the Father will send in my name, he shall teach you all things, and bring all things to your remembrance, whatsoever I have said unto you."}, {"start_ms": 181067, "end_ms": 186267, "text": "Peace I leave with you, my peace I give unto you: not as the world giveth, give I unto you."}, {"start_ms": 186267, "end_ms": 190267, "text": "Let not your heart be troubled, neither let it be afraid."}, {"start_ms": 190267, "end_ms": 195067, "text": "Ye have heard how I said unto you, I go away, and come again unto you."}, {"start_ms": 195067, "end_ms": 202800, "text": "If ye loved me, ye would rejoice, because I said, I go unto the Father: for my Father is greater than I."}, {"start_ms": 202800, "end_ms": 209333, "text": "And now I have told you before it come to pass, that, when it is come to pass, ye might believe."}, {"start_ms": 209333, "end_ms": 215600, "text": "Hereafter I will not talk much with you: for the prince of this world cometh, and hath nothing in me."}, {"start_ms": 215600, "end_ms": 221867, "text": "But that the world may know that I love the Father; and as the Father gave me commandment, even so I do."}, {"start_ms": 221867, "end_ms": 223867, "text": "Arise, let us go hence."}], "words": [{"t": "John,", "s": 301, "e": 543, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 603, "e": 924, "si": 0}, {"t": "Fourteen.", "s": 965, "e": 1407, "si": 0}, {"t": "Let", "s": 1968, "e": 2109, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 2169, "e": 2309, "si": 1}, {"t": "your", "s": 2349, "e": 2470, "si": 1}, {"t": "heart", "s": 2510, "e": 2730, "si": 1}, {"t": "be", "s": 2790, "e": 2871, "si": 1}, {"t": "troubled:", "s": 2951, "e": 3432, "si": 1}, {"t": "ye", "s": 3713, "e": 3773, "si": 1}, {"t": "believe", "s": 3853, "e": 4